    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1065">

                <pb facs="1241" n="1045" xml:id="pg1045"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.00/7–2145: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 1065<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the United
                        States Delegation</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d1065-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-21T16:00:00+02:00">July 21, 1945—4 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>[46.] Bidault accepted at once on behalf of the French Govt the proposal
                    regarding Greek elections as set out in your <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Victory</hi> 116 telegram.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d1065-f2"/></p>
                <p>Sent Frankfurt for Berlin as 46, repeated Washington 4395 and Athens 9.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
